sequenceDiagram
  title: Every block the subset reads
  %% slarti: attach api todo.api
  %% slarti: attach worker todo.worker
  %% slarti: attach db todo.db
  %% slarti: ignore clock a timer, which is not part of the system
  participant api
  participant worker
  participant db
  participant clock
  clock-)api: tick
  alt work is waiting
    api->>worker: enqueues
  else nothing to do
    Note right of api: sleeps
  end
  opt a batch is full
    api-xworker: enqueues
  end
  par write
    worker->>db: writes tasks
  and read
    api->>db: reads tasks
  end
  critical the write must land
    worker-->db: writes tasks
  option the database is down
    Note left of worker: retries
  end
  break the worker stops
    api->db: reads tasks
  end
  rect rgb(200, 220, 255)
    worker--)db: writes tasks
  end
